<ol>
<li markdown="1">In the top navigation bar, select **Interactive Apps** and choose **Desktop**.

<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_interactive_apps.png' | relative_url }}" alt="Interactive Apps menu with Desktop selected">
</details>
</li>

<li markdown="1">Set the session parameters: account, queue, number of hours, and screen resolution. The default values should be sufficient. Click **Launch** and wait until the session is active.

<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_session_parameters.png' | relative_url }}" alt="Desktop session settings for account, queue, hours, and screen resolution">
</details>
</li>

<li markdown="1">Click **Launch Desktop** to open the graphical desktop in a new browser view.

<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_launch.png' | relative_url }}" alt="Active Desktop session page with the Launch Desktop button">
</details>
</li>

<li markdown="1">Double-click the **File System** icon and open the `{{ include.root | default: "90daydata" }}` folder.

<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_file_system.png' | relative_url }}" alt="SCINet graphical desktop with the File System icon">
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_90daydata.png' | relative_url }}" alt="File System window open to the 90daydata folder">
</details>
</li>

{% if include.path %}
<li markdown="1">In the path bar at the top of the browser window, place the cursor at the end of the current path and enter `{{ include.path }}`. Press Enter to navigate to the specified path.

<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
{% if include.root == "reference" %}
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_typed_path_reference.png' | relative_url }}" alt="File System path bar with the reference dataset directory entered">
{% else %}
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_typed_path.png' | relative_url }}" alt="File System path bar with the shared user directory entered">
{% endif %}
</details>
</li>
{% endif %}

<li markdown="1">Navigate through the nested folders until you reach the `{{ include.folder }}` folder.
</li>

<li markdown="1">Double-click `{{ include.file }}`. The file opens automatically in a pop-up window.

{% unless include.noimg %}
<details class="margin-left-2 margin-top-0"><summary class="text-base"><i>see a screenshot</i></summary>
<img src="{{ '/contribute/assets/desktop_file_open.png' | relative_url }}" alt="File browser showing the FastQC HTML report file">
</details>
{% endunless %}
</li>

<li markdown="1">{{ include.next_step | default: "Now, you can review a file content in graphical interface." }}
</li>
</ol>
